  "name": "@marketcheck/mcp-client",
  "readme": "# @marketcheck/mcp-client\n\nMCP client for the [MarketCheck](https://www.marketcheck.com) automotive data API. Connects Claude Desktop, Claude Code, and other MCP-compatible AI assistants to MarketCheck's vehicle search, pricing, VIN decode, and market analytics tools.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Claude Code\n\nAdd to your project's `.mcp.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"marketcheck\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@marketcheck/mcp-client\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"MARKETCHECK_API_KEY\": \"your_api_key_here\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Claude Desktop\n\nAdd to `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json` (macOS) or `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json` (Windows):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"marketcheck\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@marketcheck/mcp-client\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"MARKETCHECK_API_KEY\": \"your_api_key_here\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Command Line\n\n```bash\n# Using environment variable\nMARKETCHECK_API_KEY=your_key npx @marketcheck/mcp-client\n\n# Using CLI flag\nnpx @marketcheck/mcp-client --api-key your_key\n\n# Custom server URL\nnpx @marketcheck/mcp-client --api-key your_key --server-url https://custom.server/mcp\n```\n\n## Available Tools\n\nOnce connected, the following MCP tools become available to your AI assistant:\n\n| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `search_active_cars` | Search active vehicle listings across US and Canada with 100+ filters |\n| `search_past_90_days` | Search recently sold/expired dealer listings (last 90 days) |\n| `predict_price_with_comparables` | AI-powered price prediction with comparable vehicle analysis |\n| `get_sold_summary` | Aggregated sold vehicle market data with ranking and grouping |\n| `get_car_history` | Complete online listing history for any VIN |\n| `decode_vin_neovin` | Full VIN decode with specs, features, MSRP, and MPG data |\n| `search_uk_active_cars` | UK market active vehicle listings |\n| `search_uk_recent_cars` | UK market recently sold/expired listings |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description | Default |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `--api-key <key>` | MarketCheck API key | `MARKETCHECK_API_KEY` env var |\n| `--server-url <url>` | MCP server endpoint | `https://mcp.marketcheck.com/mcp/sse` |\n| `--help` | Show usage information | |\n\n## Example Prompts\n\nOnce connected, try asking your AI assistant:\n\n- \"Price check VIN 1HGCV1F3XPA123456\"\n- \"What's selling in Texas right now?\"\n- \"Find me the best deal on a 2024 Toyota RAV4 near 90210\"\n- \"What's the market share for EVs this quarter?\"\n- \"How fast is a 2022 BMW X5 depreciating?\"\n\n## Get an API Key\n\nVisit [marketcheck.com](https://www.marketcheck.com) to get your API key.\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
  "readmeFilename": "README.md",
